--- !u!114 &-6360784871264985656
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3728614183372725850}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8a33feda7e59fb744bc0781a6f70a0db, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VampireGeneralController
  waitTime: 0
  ReturnPoint: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  ableToGive: 0
  patienceLevel: 20
  maxWaitTimeToGetAchievment: 300
  state: 0
  DialougeArivedAtBar:
  - "Forgif me god hlaford ic wolde biddan \xFEe for drenc\u2026. I crave thy pardon,
    and do humbly beg forgiveness for my rude and thoughtless carriage toward thee\u2026  
    Good sir, I crave thy pardon, for I would fain petition thee for a draught of
    rare delight. Methinks an absinthe, laced with but a twist of O positive and
    a curl of lime, would suit my humour passing well. Mark me, though \u2014 a twist,
    no more! For shouldst thou drown it in excess, I'll send the cup back whence
    it came, and thou shalt know my displeasure."
  DialougeUnhappyMidDrinkMake: []
  DialougePleasedMidDrinkMake:
  - "Wherefore, whither doth a man repair to find a Vestal Virgin in this latter
    age? I had a mind to ply my suit upon the computative engine, yet Tinder doth
    make me wary \u2014 for well I know that flame which burneth hot doth leave the
    suitor scorched."
  DialougeLeavingBarUpset:
  - "I thank thee for this draught, which hath verily unsealed mine eyes! For \xFEinre
    misb\xE6re on \xFEissum \xFEinge h\xE6f\xFE forseglod \xFEin wyrd and ic sceal
    blodgan \xFEe dryge for \xFEinre ofermodnesse. NAHT hr\xE6dlice ic m\xE6g eacan...
    NESE \xFEu scealt wepan of swat\xFEyrelum slawlice swa \xFEurh \xFEusend ceorfa
    on ecum sare \xFEenden ic gehealde \xFEin lif to gelencganne \xFEine \xFErowunge
    and \xFEonne anlice \xFEonne ic eom gefylled swa micel swa \xFEes drenc me ungefylledne
    h\xE6f\xFE \xFEonne cym\xFE \xFEin gebletsode forl\xE6tnes to \xFEe."
  DialougeLeavingBarHappy:
  - 'This passeth, yet mark me well: should my next coming to this tavern yield a
    draught of like concoction, thou shalt find thyself upon my rack ere the first
    blush of dawn.'
  DialougeLeavingBarPerfect:
  - "What sorcery is this, that from a simple cup doth rise such alchemy? Thou hast
    conjured, from humble draughts and unknown arts, a beverage worthy of the gods
    themselves \u2014 a golden potion whose every drop doth quench not merely thirst,
    but the very yearning of my soul."
